            "review_title": "Review at Nam's House Pizza Delivery",
            "review_text": "Richard\nNha Trang, Vietnam8 contributions\n1\nExcellent surprise! Best pizza in Nha Trang.\nJul 2021\nWe order today for the first time, the Pepperoni sausage pizza. What a surprise! It turn out to beat all other pizza place in town that we know. The cruste was thin and tasty, the pizza meat and cheese not cut corner and to be honest, a really must try out. You will love it same as we just did! Will order again! Best price in town, top quality. They also deliver, which is the option we had and we eat at home.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 1, 2021\nВаня М\nThank you!\nWritten October 1, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
